eak:break-all\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px\"><div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;line-height:16px;white-space:pre-wrap;border-spacing:0px\"><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;line-height:1.25;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">ggplot(d, aes(x, y)) + geom_tile(aes(fill=z))</font></span></pre></span></div></span></pre></span></pre></span></div><div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(29,31,33)\"><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px\"><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px\"><div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Error in grid.Call.graphics(L_raster, x$raster, x$x, x$y, x$width, x$height,  : </font></div></span></pre></span></pre></span></div><div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(29,31,33)\"><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px\"><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px\"><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><font color=\"#000000\">  Empty raster</font></font></div></span></pre></span></pre></span></div></blockquote><div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(29,31,33)\"><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px\"><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><div><br></div><div>I am not sure, but this might be related: <a href=\"http://stackover