   "subject": "Re: ggplot legend disappears when geom_title counter is over 260",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">That is weird! It looks like you already added your example to a relevant issue report.<div><a href=\"https://github.com/hadley/ggplot2/issues/943\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/hadley/ggplot2/issues/943&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370032632000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2Y0K9Dsil9INAzBJ6RjSl4\">https://github.com/hadley/ggplot2/issues/943</a></div><div><br></div><div>This error and loss of the legend appears to be triggered when your fill or color are mapped to a variable that takes only one value for certain values. I was able to trigger this with integers as low as 23 or non integers (e.g. 1.5, 6.5 and (1:50) + 0.1).</div><div>Perhaps a ggplot2 guru can help track this down.</div><div>-Allan</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br><br>On Friday, October 31, 2014 4:35:59 PM UTC-4, Rares Vernica wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Allan,</font><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">The example you posted works fine.</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Here is a reproducible example that does not work:</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><blockquote style=\"margin:0 0 0 40px;border:none;padding:0px\"><div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(29,31,33)\"><pre style=\"line-height:1.25;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;white-space:pre-wrap!important;font-size:10pt!important\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">R version 3.0.2 (2013-09-25)</font></pre></span></div><div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(29,31,33)\"><pre style=\"line-height:1.25;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;white-space:pre-wrap!important;font-size:10pt!important\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Platform: x86_64-redhat-linux-gnu (64-bit)</font></pre></span></div><div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(29,31,33)\"><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px\"><pre style=\"line-height:1.25;outline:none;border-style:none;word-break:break-all;font-size:10pt!important;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"arial, sans-serif\">ggplot2_1.0.0</font></pre></span></pre></span></div><div><span style=\"border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(29,31,33)\"><pre style=\"outline:none;border-style:none;wor